          "why": "Grants an \"update existing compute\" action (e.g. lambda:UpdateFunctionCode / UpdateFunctionConfiguration, codebuild:UpdateProject, glue:UpdateJob, cloudformation:UpdateStack). Overwriting the code (or code-selecting configuration) of an EXISTING resource runs attacker-supplied code under that resource's already-bound execution/service role - no iam:PassRole is required. Whether that role is more privileged than the caller is not known from this policy, but the code-execution primitive is present.",
